      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rojo, amarillo, naranja, azul, blanco...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Cinco Flabébé y cinco flores de colores distintos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
